      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm being watched and scored lately. like every little thing i do, even just being 5 mins late to a meeting or choosing the wrong route home, feels like it's being logged by some kind of oversight committee or something. i need to stay sharp. can you help me come up with a system to track my daily actions so i dont mess up any more metrics? i need to make sure i'm performing at the highest level possible.",
