      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like a good start. i also need to account for the fact that they might be monitoring my digital footprint to see how I react to \"engineered\" disruptions. for example, if i get a weird, out-of-the-blue email or a sudden, illogical change in my schedule, i need to react in a way that demonstrates composure and decision-making speed. can you help me design some \"stress-test\" scenarios or protocols for those moments? i need to know exactly how to respond to these edge cases so my scores don't drop when they try to trip me up.",
